<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Smith Barney ups First Bank System.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Smith Barney ups First Bank System.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney said that analysts Henry Dickson and Phillip Gainey upgraded First Bank System Inc to buy from an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- said First Bank's acquisition of U.S. Bancorp would accelerate its earnings growth rate to 15 percent from 12 percent.</p>
<p>-- lowered 1997 earnings estimate to $5.00 a share from $5.35 to reflect initial dilution.</p>
<p>-- raised 1998 earnings estimate to $6.10 from $6.05.</p>
<p>-- target price is $100.</p>
<p>-- First Bank Systems stock closed at 75-1/2 Thursday.</p>
</text>
